摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"A full set of skins for DeepSeek Harness — one repository, each theme installable on its own","id":"gh:1346951164","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-skin-pack","slug":"keman-ai/dsh-skin-pack","topics":["dark-theme","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","plugin","skin","theme","ui-theme"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"A full set of skins for DeepSeek Harness — one repository, each theme installable on its own"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"DSH Skin Pack"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"A whole shelf of skins for DeepSeek Harness."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"One repository, many themes, each installed on its own."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"dsh.a2hmarket.ai\n— see them in action, read the notes, install in one click, no login required"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"English · 简体中文"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"If this is useful to you, a Star goes a long way"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Start by browsing the DSH skin market — every skin has a full-screen preview and its design notes, a"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"nd no login is required."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"The easiest route is to install the skin market plugin once; after that every skin is searched, inst"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"alled and switched from inside dsh:"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Restart dsh once, open **Settings → Skin Market**, and search, install and switch without going back"},{"id":"p12s2","text":" open **Settings → Skin Market**, and search, install and switch without going back to the terminal."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"You can also install a single skin directly — find the version in Releases and copy that `.tgz` URL:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"> **`-w` is not optional.** The profile directory ships a `pnpm-workspace.yaml`, so pnpm reads it as"},{"id":"p15s2","text":" a workspace root and refuses to install with `ERR_PNPM_ADDING_TO_ROOT`. The flag is the \"yes, insta"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"ll into the root\" declaration."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"**Why not `github:keman-ai/dsh-skin-pack`**: pnpm has no notion of installing from a subdirectory of"},{"id":"p16s2","text":" a git repository, so a git spec pointing at this repo would pull the whole thing into your profile "},{"id":"p16s3","text":"as a single package. Hence a separate tarball per skin."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## The skins"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"31 skins. This section is generated by `scripts/readme.mjs` — do not edit by hand."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"AI Work Mode dark"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"A deep-ocean blue gradient, frosted-glass panels and a white primary action; the empty screen is one"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"ocean blue gradient, frosted-glass panels and a white primary action; the empty screen is one slogan"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"packages/dsh-ai-work-slogan"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Blue Whale Ocean dark"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Deep-ocean blue ground, translucent cyan for borders and state, ice white for highlights alone; a wh"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"ale-at-sea banner on the new-session page"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"packages/dsh-blue-whale-ocean"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Cosmic Exploration dark"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"A deep blue space ground with cool blue and nebula violet; a full cosmic-exploration cover on the ne"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"ace ground with cool blue and nebula violet; a full cosmic-exploration cover on the new-session page"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"packages/dsh-cosmic-exploration"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Cosmic Opera dark"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"A deep blue space ground with three accent steps in violet, blue and teal; a spiral-galaxy cover on "},{"id":"p29s2","text":"the new-session page"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"packages/dsh-cosmic-opera"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"Cyber Tao dark"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Obsidian ground, bronze borders, rice-paper white text, cinnabar emphasis and jade state; a mountain"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"-gate hero on the new-session page"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"packages/dsh-cyber-tao"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"Dark Xianxia dark"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"Ink-teal black ground, antique gold for edges and buttons, jade green only for running, cinnabar onl"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"y for danger; a divination hero on the new-session page"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"packages/dsh-dark-xianxia"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"Whale Girl Deep Sea dark"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"Deep-ocean blue ground, cool cyan for borders and state, DeepSeek blue for the primary action; a dee"},{"id":"p38s2","text":"p-sea hero on the new-session page"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"packages/dsh-deepseek-deep-sea"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"Twin Whale Girl dark"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"Deep-ocean blue ground, cool cyan for borders and state, DeepSeek blue for the primary action; a twi"},{"id":"p41s2","text":"n whale-girl hero on the new-session page"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"packages/dsh-deepseek-twin-whale"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"Emerald Megacity dark"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"Ink-green ground, emerald for the primary action, jade green only for running, warm gold only for bo"},{"id":"p44s2","text":"emerald for the primary action, jade green only for running, warm gold only for borders and emphasis"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"packages/dsh-emerald-megacity"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"Misty Xianxia light"},{"id":"p47s1","text":"Paper and mist white ground, ink grey for text, pale gold for edges and buttons, jade green only for"},{"id":"p47s2","text":" running; a xianxia hero on the new-session page"},{"id":"p48s1","text":"packages/dsh-extreme-xianxia-light"},{"id":"p49s1","text":"Forest Adventure dark"},{"id":"p50s1","text":"Forest green ground, moss green for the primary action, stream teal only for running, daylight yello"},{"id":"p50s2","text":"w as accent; a forest hero on the new-session page"},{"id":"p51s1","text":"packages/dsh-forest-adventure"},{"id":"p52s1","text":"Forest Companion dark"},{"id":"p53s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p54s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p55s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p56s1","text":"The skins have no dependencies on each other, so there is no incremental build — a full one is fast "},{"id":"p56s2","text":"enough that the complexity would buy nothing."},{"id":"p57s1","text":"To publish a change to one skin, bump the `version` in its `package.json`: CI decides what to publis"},{"id":"p57s2","text":"h by whether a version already has a matching Release tag, and skips every package whose version was"},{"id":"p57s3","text":" a version already has a matching Release tag, and skips every package whose version was not bumped."},{"id":"p58s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p59s1","text":"### Directory layout"},{"id":"p60s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p61s1","text":"Not committing `lib/` is the biggest difference from the standalone-repository era: back then skins "},{"id":"p61s2","text":"installed via `github:owner/repo` and what you installed was the output in the repository, so leavin"},{"id":"p61s3","text":"g it out shipped an empty shell. Now that distribution goes through Release tarballs, `npm pack` pac"},{"id":"p61s4","text":"ks the built `lib/` according to `files`, and committing it would only bloat the repository."},{"id":"p62s1","text":"## Want to build your own?"},{"id":"p63s1","text":"The fastest route is to copy any skin under `packages/` — they all share one structure, and `skin.js"},{"id":"p63s2","text":"on`, `cordis.patch.yml` and `src/client/tokens.ts` are the whole entry point."},{"id":"p64s1","text":"When it is ready, you are welcome to publish it on the DSH skin market, where anyone can browse and "},{"id":"p64s2","text":"install without logging in."},{"id":"p65s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p66s1","text":"MIT © Science Roam Limited"},{"id":"p67s1","text":"If this is useful to you, a Star goes a long way"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
